— 🇮🇷/🇮🇶 NEW: Iran’s 23rd Takavar Special Brigade carried out 14 missions inside Iraqi Kurdistan, including Erbil and Sulaymaniyah, in the past four months—eliminating various Kurdish separatist leaders

The brigade successfully returned to base after each mission, suffering zero casualties, according to an Iranian Army spokesman.

